<h1>Secret</h1>

<p>Hello, @User.Identity!.Name. This page let you in with: <b>@User.Identity.AuthenticationType</b>.</p>

<p>Call the API from this page - the browser sends the cookie, no token:</p>

<button onclick="call('/api/secret')">GET /api/secret</button>
<button onclick="call('/api/bearer-only')">GET /api/bearer-only</button>
<button onclick="call('/api/admin')">GET /api/admin</button>

<pre id="result"></pre>

<p>For calls with a bearer token, use <code>MultipleSchemes.http</code>.</p>

<script>
    async function call(url) {
        const response = await fetch(url);
        const body = await response.text();
        document.getElementById('result').textContent = `${url} -> ${response.status}\n${body}`;
    }
</script>
